027: 
028:     Input structure
029:     The grid is a rectangular array of equal-size colored frames separated by background rows and columns.
030:     Each frame has a solid one-pixel border and may contain additional pixels of its own color inside.
031: 
032:     Rule
033:     For each frame color, collect all relative positions occupied by that color across every frame of that
034:     color, then repaint those positions into every frame with that color.
