034: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
035:     """
036:     Move every red object horizontally until it is flush with the side of its enclosing blue or teal region.
037: 
038:     Input structure
039:     - The grid contains only blue, red, and teal pixels.
040:     - The red pixels form one or more 4-connected objects.
041:     - Each red object is embedded in exactly one adjacent non-red carrier color.
042: 
043:     Rule
044:     - Clear each red object back to its carrier color to recover the blue and teal regions.
045:     - A red object carried by blue moves right until its bounding box touches the right edge of that blue region.
046:     - A red object carried by teal moves left until its bounding box touches the left edge of that teal region.
047:     - Preserve the object's shape and rows, and apply all object moves simultaneously.
048: 
049:     Key insight
