008: # growing
009: 
010: # description:
011: # In the input you will see a grid with some green rectangles. Each rectangle has one red pixel on one of its borders.
012: # To make the output, you should extend the green region of each rectangle to the border of the grid in the direction of the red pixel, with the extent of the line increasing with the extent of the rectangle.
013: # Also you should draw a red line from the red pixel to the border of the grid.
